{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cyber Seekers: Conquest",
    "steam_appid": 2930410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/add13f507a93b88226064b9f74c241f4.avif?t=1753993846\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You control a Cyber Seeker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Seekers are bots used to complete high-risk bounties. You are tasked with destroying a legion of bots who have gone rogue and taken over a city. Start every run with limited resources. Receive credits for each bot you destroy and use them to upgrade your bot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The city is your playground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Seekers are equipped with various abilities and can traverse any terrain. Run on walls, grapple, glide and shoot your way through a city under fire. You will find random weapons, ability cards, and programs in each run, making them unique. Choose whatever combination that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle powerful Bots and Mechs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bot that you destroy raises the alert level. At higher alert levels, you will face tougher enemies, but you will also gain access to powerful weapons. Complete various challenges to raise the alert level and gain credits faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use modules to gain different abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden within the city are crates containing a unique module or a weapon with random stats. These can give your Cyber Seeker an edge against other bots. Higher-level crates are unlocked when enough bots are destroyed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tons of ways to traverse the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New levels will give you upgrades that will enhance your traversal abilities. But watch out for your bot's integrity. Only a limited number of bots can be deployed per mission, and if all bots are destroyed, the mission will fail, and you will lose all your weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/add13f507a93b88226064b9f74c241f4.avif?t=1753993846\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You control a Cyber Seeker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Seekers are bots used to complete high-risk bounties. You are tasked with destroying a legion of bots who have gone rogue and taken over a city. Start every run with limited resources. Receive credits for each bot you destroy and use them to upgrade your bot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/26b33341135c7659d1cb3858142d6050.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The city is your playground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Seekers are equipped with various abilities and can traverse any terrain. Run on walls, grapple, glide and shoot your way through a city under fire. You will find random weapons, ability cards, and programs in each run, making them unique. Choose whatever combination that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/87a4ad056d7454699ba9052a5a2ebe85.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle powerful Bots and Mechs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bot that you destroy raises the alert level. At higher alert levels, you will face tougher enemies, but you will also gain access to powerful weapons. Complete various challenges to raise the alert level and gain credits faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/e71b6eb744a7e2a34d40979d2aeb907b.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use modules to gain different abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden within the city are crates containing a unique module or a weapon with random stats. These can give your Cyber Seeker an edge against other bots. Higher-level crates are unlocked when enough bots are destroyed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.poster.avif?t=1753993846\" width=626 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.webm?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/af988d9f4edb5fdb394fc0d21c4e3e84.mp4?t=1753993846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tons of ways to traverse the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New levels will give you upgrades that will enhance your traversal abilities. But watch out for your bot's integrity. Only a limited number of bots can be deployed per mission, and if all bots are destroyed, the mission will fail, and you will lose all your weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a bot for hire and complete contracts in a Third-Person traversal shooter with Rogue Lite mechanics. Run on walls and use your grapple gun to traverse and hunt down rogue bots who have conquered a city.",
